  "documentLayout": {
    "embeddedField": false,
    "passwordPreview": false,
    "shapeSurfaces": "Buttons use 12px radii; fields and ordinary components use 4px. Keep workspace regions flat with restrained dividers. Use MUI shadow level 2 for transient menus or dialogs only. Ordinary outlines are 1px; focused field outlines are 2px. Runtime values belong in shared CSS and MUI tokens. Flattened alpha previews assume #F7F7FC.",
    "sharedStates": "Commands: black filled labels; brand hover/pressed use 8%/16% white; focus 2px brand ring, 2px gap; outlined labels/borders #212121; disabled labels MUI .26. MUI 9.4.0 light fields: rest label black .6, outline .23; hover outline text.primary; focus brand and 2px outline; error MUI error; disabled label .38, outline .26. Loading retains identity and geometry. UX owns availability and recovery.",
    "spacingLayout": "Use 4px, 8px, 12px, 16px and 24px spacing. Related controls and local columns: 8px; complete-field gaps and ordinary region padding: 16px; separate sections: 24px. Messages begin 4px below inputs; the next 16px field gap follows the final wrapped message. Major structure and forms use CSS Grid; compact control groups may use Flexbox. Fields start at 40px with 12px horizontal padding; buttons at 44px with 16px padding. Preserve desktop reading order and allow messages and groups to wrap.",
    "visualDirection": "Recognizable light Material UI desktop application: terracotta identity accent, cool off-white surfaces, dark text and compact Roboto hierarchy. Preserve desktop editing density and keyboard commands. Checkbox, select and hidden password specimens are reusable catalog evidence, not product requirements. Product screens and specialized timelines belong to UI composition."
  },
